    "description": "# RF-3: Referral Defaults\n\n_Pre-fill defaults that carry onto a new Sign Up but stay editable there._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Default Referrer Role — pre-fill only; the Sign Up holds the final value\n* Default Payout Type — Picklist: Cash, Redeposit; overridable at the Sign Up level\n* Default Referrer Country — not overridable at the Sign Up level\n* Default Referrer State/Province — not overridable at the Sign Up level\n* Default Referrer Currency — overridable at the Sign Up level\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Currency and Payout Type can be overridden per Sign Up; Country and State/Province cannot\n\n* Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:36:30](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5790): \"...I think it's just refer country and refer state, province. You don't have to override these two things.\"\n\n* \"Take out referrer role\" — unresolved which field this means\n\n* Not confirmed which field this refers to — Joyce second-guesses herself mid-sentence in the transcript. Confirm directly against this field list before building it as scoped.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-3 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-3 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 1:36:30 (override scope)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5790)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
